# Performance traces are hundreds of MB each and are deliberately not tracked.
# They are listed by explicit path rather than by directory or by "*.json",
# because the same directories also hold small, useful JSON results
# (attribution.json, forwards.json, and a few small tracer_out-*.json).
#
# A new run that produces another large tracer_out-*.json should add its path
# here rather than relying on a wildcard: the small files in these very same
# directories are worth keeping.
